TEXT 32 32 Left 3 ;#327 Wilson PNP current mirror with Alan's adjustable load
TEXT 32 96 Left 2 ;Source: Alan Wolke (W2AEW), https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2IbWvq7Abv4
TEXT 32 144 Left 2 ;Q1 and diode-connected Q2 set the current, and Q3 passes Q2's current to the load. Turning the R2 pot now barely changes the output current.
TEXT 32 1136 Left 2 ;VSENSE is ammeter M1. Vload is Alan's voltmeter across R2. R2TOP and R2BOTTOM are the 10k pot; the loop ties its wiper to the grounded end.
TEXT 32 1168 Left 2 ;RSET is the pot setting in ohms. The 1m floor is only there because LTspice rejects a 0 ohm resistor.
TEXT 32 1216 Left 2 !.step param RSET 0 10k 100
TEXT 32 1248 Left 2 !.op
